=== Verification traps caught rather than reported ===
The dev render probe returns no samples until a recorder is started, so loop liveness
was proven by comparing screenshot hashes across time. The navigation counter
double-counted per load, so a plain reload was measured as a control before counting
retries. A session-scoped install hint made an early first-load-failure test miss its
target, so it was re-run after clearing sessionStorage.

=== Deliberately not done ===
The sampleLoader retryability test substitutes a fake engine and so does not pin
AudioEngine's real retry behaviour. The 4,249.03 KiB figures in docs/playtest.md and
conductor/tech-stack.md are historical phase measurements and were left as recorded
history. Synchronous edge setup before the try, including new WebGLRenderer() on a
device without WebGL2, stays outside the failure boundary: FR4 scoped recovery to the
driven and ready promises, so that is a future-track candidate, not a defect.

=== Out of scope by design ===
WebGL context-loss handling, service-worker/PWA redesign, bundle splitting, CI/E2E
infrastructure, and the mission dependency cycle. No new dependency, asset, framework,
registry entry, or visible text surface.
